# round 103 (w121): seeds 2703 to 2708 of the cell with NO metabolism (pathway multi-hot with ProtT5, pooled readout, nothing on the logit; round 75 arm w94 pathpool) on the ten repeated outer splits, taking it to nine seeds per split. It is the control the single-experiment module recipe (w104: YPD ratio, YPD flux vector, rule counts; nine seeds) is read against for the question whether the module helps a record that is one genotype in one medium. Read fixed here: per-split seed-mean paired difference w104 minus this arm, mean, sd and sign count over ten splits; and per SEED within each split, the share of the 90 (split, seed) pairs on which the module cell scores higher.
